WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.029 --> 00:00:04.696
(playful music)

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:12.227
♪ It must be love ♪

00:00:12.227 --> 00:00:15.144
♪ It must be love ♪

00:00:18.232 --> 00:00:20.066
- {Interviewer] Wow,
you're looking cozy today.

00:00:20.066 --> 00:00:22.883
- Yeah well I like to
hang out in here sometimes

00:00:22.883 --> 00:00:25.966
because it's warmer than the cabinet.

00:00:26.872 --> 00:00:28.872
- [Interviewer] So where's
your partner, Butter?

00:00:28.872 --> 00:00:31.773
- Oh, we're not always together.

00:00:31.773 --> 00:00:36.023
I think Butter went to a
potluck or a cookie party.

00:00:37.128 --> 00:00:38.931
Is that a thing?

00:00:38.931 --> 00:00:40.848
I'll just text and ask.

00:00:43.709 --> 00:00:46.459
Oh, they haven't texted back yet.

00:00:50.291 --> 00:00:52.587
Maybe Butter's been in the bathroom.

00:00:52.587 --> 00:00:54.179
- [Interviewer] For an hour?

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:57.279
- Well, Butter's lactose intolerant.

00:00:57.279 --> 00:01:00.196
It's very common in Ashkenazi Jews,

00:01:01.288 --> 00:01:05.602
So yeah, it could be hours
before we see them again.

00:01:05.602 --> 00:01:07.331
- [Interviewer] Yeah but
don't people usually take

00:01:07.331 --> 00:01:08.621
their phones with them if they're gonna be

00:01:08.621 --> 00:01:10.168
in the bathroom for a long time?

00:01:10.168 --> 00:01:12.501
(sad music)

00:01:14.411 --> 00:01:15.447
- This is cool.

00:01:15.447 --> 00:01:16.280
I'm cool.

00:01:17.283 --> 00:01:21.101
♪Independent Toasty coming through. ♪

00:01:21.101 --> 00:01:25.184
(continues singing to themself)

00:01:29.315 --> 00:01:31.853
- Toast, good thing you called your BFF,

00:01:31.853 --> 00:01:34.147
because this is fucked up.

00:01:34.147 --> 00:01:36.269
It's been two hours.

00:01:36.269 --> 00:01:38.339
If my boo, (pronounces with
heavy accent) Machalanan

00:01:38.339 --> 00:01:40.024
doesn't text me back within five,

00:01:40.024 --> 00:01:40.941
he's toast.

00:01:42.293 --> 00:01:43.747
Sorry.

00:01:43.747 --> 00:01:45.848
You know what I mean.

00:01:45.848 --> 00:01:48.077
- A really derogatory term.

00:01:48.077 --> 00:01:49.187
- I'm sorry.

00:01:49.187 --> 00:01:50.219
- Prefer you didn't.

00:01:50.219 --> 00:01:51.235
It's award.

00:01:51.235 --> 00:01:53.622
Okay, what if Butter's hurt or something?

00:01:53.622 --> 00:01:55.725
Or like, Butter fell

00:01:55.725 --> 00:01:58.481
and is in some sewer somewhere?

00:01:58.481 --> 00:02:01.362
I mean, Butter's just so slippery.

00:02:01.362 --> 00:02:03.091
What if Butter's with someone else?

00:02:03.091 --> 00:02:04.792
Like, some Pop tart

00:02:04.792 --> 00:02:05.976
or muffin

00:02:05.976 --> 00:02:06.809
or bagel?

00:02:08.461 --> 00:02:09.912
- OMG!

00:02:09.912 --> 00:02:12.355
Butter was tagged on Insta at the mall

00:02:12.355 --> 00:02:13.720
10 minutes ago.

00:02:13.720 --> 00:02:15.139
- What?!

00:02:15.139 --> 00:02:16.994
Is that a dog?

00:02:16.994 --> 00:02:19.864
Wait, don't dogs eat butter?

00:02:19.864 --> 00:02:21.877
Don't dogs eat butter?!

00:02:21.877 --> 00:02:23.224
Aaaaaah!

00:02:23.224 --> 00:02:24.813
- Peanut butter, not butter.

00:02:24.813 --> 00:02:26.349
Get a hold of yourself.

00:02:26.349 --> 00:02:28.516
- (moans)

00:02:29.613 --> 00:02:31.683
- Don't do it, don't text them.

00:02:31.683 --> 00:02:33.805
- I just want one more little,

00:02:33.805 --> 00:02:35.069
little text.
- No!

00:02:35.069 --> 00:02:38.749
Like, a small emoji, an easygoing emoji.

00:02:38.749 --> 00:02:39.971
Like a penguin.

00:02:39.971 --> 00:02:41.526
It's super casual.

00:02:41.526 --> 00:02:44.067
It'll be super chill.
- You can't text them anymore.

00:02:44.067 --> 00:02:44.973
- I'm not letting you.

00:02:44.973 --> 00:02:46.566
- Just one more little text.

00:02:46.566 --> 00:02:48.483
- No, no!
- Let me text!

00:02:50.619 --> 00:02:52.378
- [Interviewer] What's all this?

00:02:52.378 --> 00:02:54.859
- Oh, I'm breaking up with Butter.

00:02:54.859 --> 00:02:56.872
- [Interviewer] Wait, its
only been three hours.

00:02:56.872 --> 00:02:58.987
Don't you think you two
might be overreacting?

00:02:58.987 --> 00:03:01.120
- No, I don't think I'm overreacting.

00:03:01.120 --> 00:03:04.310
- How dare you belittle my BFF's feelings

00:03:04.310 --> 00:03:06.633
in their time of need.
(Toast sobbing)

00:03:06.633 --> 00:03:07.466
It's okay.

00:03:08.502 --> 00:03:10.252
Don't cry, it's okay.

00:03:11.566 --> 00:03:15.233
(shushes as Toast whimpers)

00:03:16.377 --> 00:03:18.575
- Checking all Butter's
social media accounts.

00:03:18.575 --> 00:03:19.729
(keyboard clacking)

00:03:19.729 --> 00:03:22.936
I'm checking Twitter,
I'm checking #Buttersdead

00:03:22.936 --> 00:03:24.342
Buttersf(bleep)cking dead.

00:03:24.342 --> 00:03:27.489
Oh my God, hashtag Butter's dead.

00:03:27.489 --> 00:03:28.941
I haven't seen anything yet.

00:03:28.941 --> 00:03:31.245
But if Butter's not dead,

00:03:31.245 --> 00:03:35.448
(whispers ominously) he will be soon.

00:03:35.448 --> 00:03:40.448
(Cupcake and Toast
tweaking out to rock music)

00:03:41.677 --> 00:03:44.387
- [Interviewer] Has Butter
texted you back yet?

00:03:44.387 --> 00:03:45.220
- No.

00:03:46.947 --> 00:03:49.864
Butter's definitely 100% dead.

00:03:51.181 --> 00:03:52.681
- Sad, sorry test.

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:55.544
- [Interviewer] Wait, dead?

00:03:55.544 --> 00:03:58.838
That seems like a pretty crazy conclusion.

00:03:58.838 --> 00:04:00.908
- I guess I'll just have to get used to

00:04:00.908 --> 00:04:05.158
being a butter less toast. (moans)

00:04:06.732 --> 00:04:11.732
(Cupcake and Toast completely
freaking out to rock music)

00:04:13.423 --> 00:04:18.138
- I can't believe Butter is
dead in a ditch somewhere.

00:04:18.138 --> 00:04:21.048
Probably happy in a raccoon,

00:04:21.048 --> 00:04:22.661
or Paula Deen.

00:04:22.661 --> 00:04:24.851
They're running rampant

00:04:24.851 --> 00:04:26.805
- [Cupcake] Hey Toasties, hang in there.

00:04:26.805 --> 00:04:29.055
I'll call and check on you in the morning.

00:04:29.055 --> 00:04:30.972
(kiss)

00:04:36.661 --> 00:04:40.244
(melodramatic piano music)

00:04:49.765 --> 00:04:50.598
- Hey Babe!

00:04:50.598 --> 00:04:51.535
Sorry I'm so late,

00:04:51.535 --> 00:04:53.530
My phone died.

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:55.439
- Oh! You were not here?

00:04:55.439 --> 00:04:59.450
I didn't even f(bleep)cking notice.

00:04:59.450 --> 00:05:00.730
- [Butter] Hey Toast, was there

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:03.063
an Amber Alert about myself?

00:05:05.354 --> 00:05:09.365
♪ It must be love ♪

00:05:09.365 --> 00:05:13.685
♪ It must be love ♪

00:05:13.685 --> 00:05:18.685
♪ It seems that only I can see ♪

00:05:19.050 --> 00:05:22.550
♪ The love she has for me ♪

